igured","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Origin","isActive":true},{"text":", selecting between PIN and built-in user verification, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"processing extensions before the request reaches the authenticator.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Use ","type":"text"},{"code":"Client","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for any app that runs passkey ceremonies. Reach for ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/Session","isActive":true},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"directly only when you need lower-level access — raw ","type":"text"},{"code":"makeCredential","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" \/","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"getAssertion","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", credential management, or bio enrollment.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"Client","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is an actor; a client’s lifetime is bound to the underlying ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/Session","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The constructor takes four parameters that shape every ceremony:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origin"},{"text":" — the secure origin the client is bound to. ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Origin","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" enforces","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the W3C secure-context rule; the client refuses to sign for relying parties whose","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"identifier doesn’t match.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isPublicSuffix"},{"text":" — a closure into a Public Suffix List, used to validate that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the relying-party identifier is a registrable suffix of the origin’s effective","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"domain.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"enterpriseRpIds"},{"text":" — relying-party identifiers allowed to receive","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"platform-managed enterprise attestation. When the request specifies","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/AttestationPreference\/enterprise","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", the client escalates to level 2","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(platform-managed) for RPs in this set, and uses level 1 (vendor-facilitated)","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"otherwise.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"allowedExtensions"},{"text":" — the set of WebAuthn extensions the client will process.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Anything the relying party requests outside this set is dropped before reaching","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the authenticator. Defaults to ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Extension","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"’s standard set.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"PIN and user verification are supplied per ceremony via ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Authorization","isActive":true},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"out-